{"_id":"68a736128ec3d8323af14683","roadmapSlug":"data-analyst","nodeId":"XlCv2OirEfuBFa4ranyyE","createdAt":"2025-08-21T15:06:58.099Z","description":"# CNNs\n\nConvolutional Neural Networks (CNNs) are a type of deep neural network designed for processing grid-structured data like images. They use convolutional layers to automatically learn spatial features such as edges, textures, and shapes. CNNs are the standard architecture for image classification, object detection, and computer vision tasks.","resources":[{"type":"article","title":"What are convolutional neural networks?","url":"https://www.ibm.com/topics/convolutional-neural-networks","_id":"6a7f4a4fcb44947debcf59d9"},{"type":"video","title":"What are Convolutional Neural Networks (CNNs)?","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QzY57FaENXg","_id":"6a7f4a4fcb44947debcf59da"}],"updatedAt":"2026-08-14T17:03:11.488Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a8894ecaca636c6b9e973f1","title":"DataCamp - Associate Data Analyst in SQL","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/1GK1qD"},{"_id":"6a5e04dcfb5fcb94d041675b","title":"DataCamp - Data Analyst with Python","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/AgYmJK"},{"_id":"6a5e189a077863512aba4c73","title":"roadmap.sh - Master SQL","partner":"roadmap.sh","type":"course","url":"https://roadmap.sh/courses/sql"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/data-analyst/content/XlCv2OirEfuBFa4ranyyE.md"}